    title: A subscriber-only post
    see: The post's opening, a word count, and a Subscribe and read here button. The full text isn't on the page.
    why: The blog answers 402 Payment Required, with a pointer to the offers for this group of posts.
  - img: a2-signin
    alt: "The License Server's sign-in page, a separate site from the blog."
    title: Sign in at the License Server
    see: A sign-in page on the License Server, a separate site from the blog. In the demo, any name works.
    why: The blog started a standard OAuth sign-in from its own server. The blog never sees a password.
